@startuml 02_use_cases_automation
left to right direction
actor "Unpaired device agent" as Unpaired
actor "Paired device agent" as Agent
actor "Approved workspace admin" as Admin
actor "External checker (FL-19)" as Scheduler
rectangle "FleetLuma cloud API (v0.1.0 design)" {
 usecase "Request expiring pairing code" as Request
 usecase "Poll pairing with private device secret" as Poll
 usecase "Validate admin JWT + membership" as AdminAuth
 usecase "Approve/deny pairing" as Decide
 usecase "Register host and token hash atomically" as Register
 usecase "Authenticate active agent token" as Authenticate
 usecase "Receive monitoring report" as Ingest
 usecase "Persist samples + heartbeat atomically" as Persist
 usecase "Revoke agent" as Revoke
 usecase "Run approved public HTTP probe (deferred)" as Probe
}
Unpaired --> Request
Unpaired --> Poll
Admin --> Decide
Admin --> Revoke
Decide ..> AdminAuth : <<include>>
Decide ..> Register : <<include>>
Revoke ..> AdminAuth : <<include>>
Agent --> Ingest
Ingest ..> Authenticate : <<include>>
Ingest ..> Persist : <<include>>
Scheduler --> Probe
note bottom of Ingest
 Token is unrelated to Supabase operator JWT.
 Invalid/revoked token never updates heartbeat.
end note
@enduml
